[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2492393691","pull_request_review_id":3419066564,"id":2492393691,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ujujb","diff_hunk":"@@ -362,6 +363,7 @@ EditorMaterialPreviewPlugin::EditorMaterialPreviewPlugin() {\n \tRS::get_singleton()->viewport_set_scenario(viewport, scenario);\n \tRS::get_singleton()->viewport_set_size(viewport, 128, 128);\n \tRS::get_singleton()->viewport_set_transparent_background(viewport, true);\n+\tRS::get_singleton()->viewport_set_msaa_3d(viewport, RS::VIEWPORT_MSAA_4X);","path":"editor/inspector/editor_preview_plugins.cpp","commit_id":"0ec81a180834ef2571f1a41f1c2ef260ba8c722a","original_commit_id":"40b9b59d7de6730f892955b38995d0231a26d416","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"As done in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97468, to further improve quality:\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n\t// Use 4× MSAA and 4× SSAA to avoid aliasing on edges and improve texture quality, which helps with thumbnail recognition.\r\n\tRS::get_singleton()->viewport_set_msaa_3d(viewport, RS::VIEWPORT_MSAA_4X);\r\n\tRS::get_singleton()->viewport_set_scaling_3d_scale(viewport, 2.0);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis works on every renderer nowadays, and the internal buffer size is 256×256 (for a 128×128 icon), which remains compatible with every device. In terms of performance, it shouldn't impact generation times noticeably, since the thumbnail generation time is often dominated by CPU setup time, as well as saving the image file (compression). Many of the pixels we're rendering for the thumbnail are also just the background color, so we don't pay as much of a fillrate performance cost as we would in a scene fully covered in materials.","created_at":"2025-11-05T00:20:06Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T00:27:31Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112325#discussion_r2492393691","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112325","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2492393691"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112325#discussion_r2492393691"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112325"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2492393691/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":366,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":12,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]